& [HardConstraints]
  + full unchanged A6 replay before A7 admission; ordinal seven is the sole mutable current packet descriptor
  + exact canonical forms and bounded resources; matching metadata is descriptive and never private permit authority
  + opaque and evidence references remain inert and non-echoed; no secret resolver issuer trust clock revocation consumption or effect capability
  + public fixtures are synthetic only; no credential token key private locator or permit body enters Git logs stderr stdout narrative or graphs
  + all eighteen A7 authority claims false and all twenty-two effects zero; one attempt zero retry zero cleanup
& [HostConstraints]
  + D-drive worktree and build scratch only; reviewed scripts may use process-scoped RemoteSigned with no persistent change
  + no WSL remote machine download provider fallback or policy weakening; provider_unavailable remains zero-trial
& [Invalidators]
